; $VER: Envoy-PackageStartup 1.0 (7.10.2026)
; Envoy-PackageStartup (c) The AROS Dev Team.
;
; Run at boot from ENV:SYS/Packages/Envoy. Starts the Envoy servers in the
; background when ENV:Envoy/AutoRun is "True". It does not wait for the
; network stack: nipc.library connects to it once it is up.
; The current directory is the package directory, SYS:System/Network/Envoy.

If ${Envoy/AutoRun} eq "True"
    ; first start: offer the filesystem service (exports are configured separately)
    If NOT EXISTS ENVARC:Envoy/services.prefs
        ServicesConfig >NIL: CFGFILE=S/services.default SAVE
    EndIf
    Run >NIL: QUIET ServicesManager
    Run >NIL: QUIET AccountsServer
EndIf
